  "trustHomeMeaning": "Fire counts on this screen are active thermal detections from the last 24 hours, not confirmed wildfires — some may be agricultural burns or industrial heat sources.",
  "trustHomeSource": "Data comes from NASA FIRMS (Fire Information for Resource Management System), combining VIIRS and MODIS satellite passes, refreshed every 3 hours.",
  "trustHomeInterpret": "A high fire count in a region doesn't always mean high danger — check the Risk tab for weather-adjusted risk scores before drawing conclusions.",
  "trustHomeAction": "Tap any fire card for full details, or add it to your Watchlist to track updates. If you're near an active fire, check Notifications for real-time alerts.",

  "trustMapMeaning": "Each marker is a single satellite hotspot detection, not necessarily an active fire — the confidence level shown in fire details indicates how reliable the detection is.",
  "trustMapSource": "Fire data sourced from NASA FIRMS (VIIRS & MODIS satellites). Secondary verification via EFFIS (Copernicus Emergency Management Service) will be added when their API is restored.",
  "trustMapInterpret": "Clustered numbers mean multiple detections are close together — zoom in to see individual points. Tighter clusters often indicate a larger, ongoing fire.",
  "trustMapAction": "See a fire in person that isn't on the map? Use the Report button to alert others. Tap \"Nearby Fires\" to see what's close to your current location.",

  "trustRiskMeaning": "The risk score (0-100) estimates wildfire likelihood by combining temperature, humidity, wind speed, and dryness — it is a forecast, not a guarantee.",
  "trustRiskSource": "Weather data is pulled from live meteorological feeds; fire counts factor in recent NASA FIRMS detections for each region.",
  "trustRiskInterpret": "Compare your region's score to the Turkey average on the chart — a score significantly above average signals elevated local conditions worth monitoring.",
  "trustRiskAction": "If your region shows Critical or High risk, avoid open flames and report any smoke immediately. Switch to the \"My Location\" tab for a personalized breakdown.",

  "trustNewsMeaning": "Headlines are automatically filtered to keep only wildfire, disaster, and emergency-related coverage — unrelated political or sports stories are excluded.",
  "trustNewsSource": "Articles are aggregated from 9 established Turkish news outlets via their public RSS feeds, refreshed continuously throughout the day.",
  "trustNewsInterpret": "A \"Breaking\" badge means the article was published very recently — always check the publish time, as wildfire situations can change quickly.",
  "trustNewsAction": "Use the Translate button to read non-English articles, or tap \"Related Fires\" on a story to jump directly to that location on the map.",

  "trustAlertsMeaning": "Alerts notify you when a satellite detects a fire within 50km of your last known location — they are automated and based on detection data, not verified reports.",
